<title>BELARUS: Belarus GDP rises 10 pct in Jan-Apr vs year-ago.</title>
<headline>Belarus GDP rises 10 pct in Jan-Apr vs year-ago.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarussian Gross Domestic Product (GDP) rose 10.0 percent over January-April to 85.6 trillion Belarussian roubles compared to year-ago levels, the Statistics Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>		  PERCENTAGE CHANGE IN BELARUSSIAN GDP</p>
<p>				     Apr 97     Mar 97	Apr 96</p>
<p> month-on-month		  +7.0	 +7.0	  N/A</p>
<p> year-on-year		    +14.4	+5.3	  -2.0</p>
<p>--Larisa Sayenko, Minsk Newsroom +375-017-227-3594 ($1 = about 36,000 Belarussian roubles)</p>
</text>
